<article class="legal-page-wrapper">
  <div class="legal-page-container">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <span class="legal-pill">Help &amp; Documentation</span>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Download &amp; Format FAQs</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Everything you need to know about accessing, extracting, and working with Digvolly digital assets.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card glass-panel legal-card">
      <div class="legal-prose">
        
        <div class="faq-group">
          <h2>Access &amp; Delivery</h2>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">⚡ How do I access my files after purchase?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Access is <strong>immediate</strong>. As soon as your payment is confirmed at checkout, an order confirmation screen appears with instant one-click download buttons for each purchased asset in ZIP format.
              </p>
              <p>
                Additionally, an automatic email backup containing permanent direct download links is dispatched to your email within seconds.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">🔄 Can I re-download my purchased assets later?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                <strong>Yes, you have permanent lifetime access.</strong> You can access your downloads at any time via the link in your email receipt, or by logging into your Digvolly account under purchase history. There are no download expiration windows.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">⚠️ What should I do if my download link fails or expires?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                If a network interruption occurs, simply refresh the download page or click the link in your email receipt. If you encounter any download issues, email <a href="mailto:support@digvolly.com">support@digvolly.com</a> or visit our <a href="/pages/contact">Studio Support</a> page with your order number, and our team will reissue fresh download links immediately.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">
          <h2>File Formats &amp; Software Compatibility</h2>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">📁 What file formats are included in my purchase?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Included formats vary by product type and are specified under the &ldquo;Format &amp; File Specifications&rdquo; section on every product page:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Vector Patterns &amp; Graphics:</strong> AI (Adobe Illustrator), EPS10 (universal vector), SVG (web vector), and high-resolution transparent PNGs (300/600 DPI).</li>
                <li><strong>Presentation Decks:</strong> PPTX (PowerPoint), KEY (Keynote), and Figma files.</li>
                <li><strong>eBooks &amp; Guides:</strong> Searchable PDF, EPUB, and Notion template links.</li>
                <li><strong>Textures &amp; Backgrounds:</strong> Ultra-high-resolution JPGs (up to 6000&times;4000px) and TIFFs.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">💻 What software do I need to open and edit these files?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Our assets are created using universal, industry-standard file formats compatible across major design software:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Vector files (.AI, .EPS, .SVG):</strong> Adobe Illustrator, CorelDRAW, Affinity Designer, Figma, Canva, or Inkscape (free).</li>
                <li><strong>Raster files (.PNG, .JPG):</strong> Adobe Photoshop, Procreate, Canva, Figma, Affinity Photo, or any image editor.</li>
                <li><strong>Presentation files (.PPTX, .KEY):</strong> Microsoft PowerPoint, Apple Keynote, Google Slides, or Figma.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3 class="faq-question">🎨 Are the design files layered and fully editable?</h3>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                <strong>Yes.</strong> All vector files (AI, EPS, SVG) feature organized, named, and grouped layers. You can easily adjust colors, resize elements infinitely without pixelation, toggle background layers, and edit stroke weights. Transparent PNGs are pre-isolated for drag-and-drop workflow in tools like Canva and Figma.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">
          <h2>Need Further Assistance?</h2>
          <p>
            Have a question not answered here? Our studio support specialists are available Monday through Friday to assist you.
          </p>
          <div class="legal-callout">
            <strong>Contact Support</strong><br>
            Visit <a href="/pages/contact">Studio Support</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@digvolly.com">support@digvolly.com</a>.<br>
            Typical response time: Under 24 business hours.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

